TheoremOS is the mathematical research runtime extracted from
DeepScientist (https://github.com/ResearAI/DeepScientist), of which the
TheoremOS author is a co-author. The files listed in extraction.json were
taken from the DeepScientist mathematics fork at commit 232fd23 and have
since been modified. That revision used AGPL-3.0-only by default, with
per-file and third-party exceptions. Its authors retain their rights.

